Hi,

Is this a tumor-only tool? Or can tumor-normal paired samples be analyzed as well? If so, how is the distinction between tumor and normal samples be made? I'm just kind of confused because the vignette discusses the normal_index specifying the indices of normal samples.

Thank you.

